{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-05T16:56:54+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-05T16:56:54+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Andritz AG","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"Austria","city":"Graz","website":"https://www.andritz.com","employees":30738,"summary":"Andritz AG engages in the provision of industrial machinery, equipment, and services in Europe, North America, South America, China, Asia, Africa, Australia, and internationally. It operates through four segments: Pulp & Paper, Metals, Hydropower, and Environment & Energy. The Pulp & Paper segment provides technology, automation, and service solutions to produce pulp, paper, board, and tissue; boilers for power generation; nonwovens technologies; panelboard production systems; and recycling, shredding, and energy solutions for various waste materials. Its Metals segment provides technologies, plants, and digital solutions, including automation and software solutions, and process know-how and services; and solutions for the production and processing of flat products for welding systems and furnaces, as well as services for the metals processing industry. The Hydro segment supplies electromechanical equipment, solutions, and services for hydropower stations; services and digital solutions for the operation and maintenance of hydropower plants; and turbo generators for the thermal industry. The Environment & Energy segment provides technologies to produce green hydrogen and renewable fuels, carbon capture and emission reduction, mechanical and thermal solid/liquid separation, grinding, pelletizing, and pumping fluids. It also serves agriculture, aluminum, architecture, automotive and e-mobility, carbon steel, chemicals, desalination, environment, feed, food and beverages, glass, kraft pulp, lime and cement, marine/offshore, mining and minerals, non-ferrous metals, non-woven and textile, oil and gas, panelboard, paper and packaging, pharmaceutical, power generation, recycling, solid biofuels, stainless steel, sugar, thermal power, tissue, and waste industries. The company was founded in 1852 and is headquartered in Graz, Austria.","exchange":"Vienna","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Andritz AG s'engage dans la fourniture de machines industrielles, d'équipements et de services en Europe, en Amérique du Nord, en Amérique du Sud, en Chine, en Asie, en Afrique, en Australie et à l'international. Elle exerce ses activités dans quatre secteurs : les pâtes et papiers, les métaux, l'hydroélectricité et l'environnement et l'énergie. Le segment Pulp & Paper fournit des solutions de technologie, d'automatisation et de service pour produire de la pâte, du papier, du carton et des tissus; des chaudières pour la production d'électricité; des technologies non tissées; des systèmes de production de panneaux; et des solutions de recyclage, de déchiquetage et d'énergie pour divers déchets."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":8084900352,"shares_outstanding":97998794,"trailing_pe":16.905737,"forward_pe":13.871212,"price_to_book":3.131524,"ev_to_ebitda":9.194,"ev_to_revenue":0.891,"dividend_yield":0.033,"payout_ratio":0.5533,"beta_yahoo":1.286},"targets":{"current_price":82.5,"mean":94.0,"median":95.0,"high":104.0,"low":80.0,"n_analysts":8,"reco_mean":1.5,"reco_key":"strong_buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-10-29"],"eps_avg":1.96992,"eps_low":1.96992,"eps_high":1.96992,"revenue_avg":2399100000,"ex_dividend":"2026-03-30","dividend_date":"1970-08-23"},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.315,"institutions_pct":0.3435,"institutions_float_pct":0.50146,"institutions_n":291,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0,"shares":581,"value":47932,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.2911}],"funds":[{"name":"Capital Income Builder","pct":0.0117999995,"shares":1228617,"value":101360902,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":1.0},{"name":"VANGUARD STAR